<title>SWEDEN: SOCCER-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KARLSKOGA, Sweden 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the women's</p>
<p>European soccer Championship on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Spain 0 Sweden 1 (halftime 0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers: Judith Corominas (6, own goal)</p>
<p>Russia 1 France 3 (halftime 0-1)</p>
<p>Scocers:</p>
<p>France - Angelique Roujas  27, 56, 74.</p>
<p>Russia - Irina Grigorieva  52</p>
</text>
